    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "高祖討劉毅，鍾率軍繼王鎮惡。",
      "reading": "討劉毅，鍾繼王鎮惡。",
      "note": "討劉毅，鍾繼王鎮惡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
