    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-14",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "江陵平定，仍隨朱齡石伐蜀，為前鋒，由外水，至于彭模，去成都二百里。",
      "reading": "隨朱齡石伐蜀。",
