      "start_codepoint": 47,
      "end_codepoint": 72,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-72",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "鍾于時脚疾不能行，齡石乃詣鍾謀曰：「今天時盛熱，而賊嚴兵固險，攻之未必可拔，祇增疲困。",
      "reading": "鍾因足疾不能行，齡石往詢。",
      "note": "鍾因足疾不能行，齡石往詢。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 72,
      "end_codepoint": 115,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-115",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "計其人情恇撓，必不久安，且欲養銳息兵，以伺其隙。",
      "reading": "齡石自述緩兵之議。",
      "note": "齡石自述緩兵之議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 115,
      "end_codepoint": 139,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-139",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "隙而乘之，乃可捷事。",
      "reading": "又申其詞。",
      "note": "又申其詞。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 139,
      "end_codepoint": 149,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-149",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "然決機兩陳，公本有所委，卿意謂何﹖」鍾曰：「不然。",
      "reading": "齡石徵詢鍾，鍾表示不同意。",
      "note": "齡石徵詢鍾，鍾表示不同意。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 149,
      "end_codepoint": 174,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-174",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "前揚聲言大眾向內水，譙道福不敢舍涪城。",
      "reading": "鍾述先前言向內水及譙道福所在。",
      "note": "鍾述先前言向內水及譙道福所在。",
