      "start_codepoint": 193,
      "end_codepoint": 211,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-211",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "賊今阻兵守險，是其懼不敢戰，非能持久堅守也。",
      "reading": "鍾續答。",
      "note": "鍾續答。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 211,
      "end_codepoint": 233,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-233",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "因其兇懼，盡銳攻之，其勢必克。",
      "reading": "鍾續論。",
      "note": "鍾續論。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 233,
      "end_codepoint": 248,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-248",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "鼓行而進，成都必不能守矣。",
      "reading": "鍾預斷成都局面。",
      "note": "鍾預斷成都局面。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 248,
      "end_codepoint": 261,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-261",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "今若緩兵相守，彼將知人虛實，涪軍忽并來力距我，人情既安，良將又集，此求戰不獲，軍食無資，當為蜀子虜耳。」",
      "reading": "鍾述相守時的憂慮。",
      "note": "鍾述相守時的憂慮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 261,
      "end_codepoint": 313,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:received_sentence4-313",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "vcd_ee3_q63",
      "source_quote": "齡石從之。",
      "reading": "齡石採其言。",
      "note": "齡石採其言。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-049-liuzhong:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 313,
      "end_codepoint": 318,
      "human_reviewed": false
